2026-10-31T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Workspace services stay DNS-only
 # uuid: 6a5aa2c7-dfc7-55b7-a883-693d2bceb126
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:flight-level:l2, rfd:attest-in:details
