 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-31T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2356) 'the DNS records of every workspace service.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Workspace services stay DNS-only, so no CDN reads their traffic.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2356) 'A proxied record puts Cloudflare between a client and the service for every request.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2356) 'If a workspace service lands under a proxied subdomain, take the proxy flag off before it serves requests.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Workspace services stay DNS-only
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2356) 'CF-proxied records have Cloudflare terminating TLS at its edge, every byte plaintext at CF for the round trip. Workspace services stay DNS-only; edge cache, if needed, is Fly-side or origin-side.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2356) 'RFD66606-2146. Split from the old RFD66606-2147: RFD66606-2353 (replicas), 2354 (unseal), 2355 (cache).
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2356) 'No CDN proxy in front of workspace services
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Cloudflare's `proxied: true` mode has CF terminating TLS at its edge using its Universal SSL cert and re-encrypting to origin. Every byte of the request headers and body is plaintext at CF for the round trip. CF is not the workspace's tenant. That is a MITM regardless of intent, and it is not compatible with services that carry auth tokens or hostname-bound credentials.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Records for services this workspace runs stay `proxied: false`. Edge caching, if it is ever needed, lives Fly-side (Fly's own Anycast + edge) or origin-side (an in-process cache).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2356) 'One record in the `chibifire.com` zone as of 2026-09-01 is CF-proxied: `hub-700a.chibifire.com`, pointing at `173.180.240.105 / 2001:569:7e58:dd00:...`. That is a personal home network endpoint, outside this workspace's scope. If a workspace service ever lands under a subdomain that is currently proxied, the proxy flag comes off before the service starts serving requests.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2356) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2356) 'Services here carry auth tokens and hostname-bound credentials.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2356  1 LINE
 Text:Written
